DTSTAMP:20260528T042354Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260808T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260816T090000
SUMMARY:Come to BC With Us!
DESCRIPTION:These Boots Are Made for Hiking\nGrab your Hiking boots and po
 les and come to BC with us!\nThis is a week of day hikes - some challengin
 g and some just downright beautiful. We will be day hiking for 7 days begi
 nning in Vancouver heading to Tofino Beach then back to Vancouver.\nThe it
 inerary has changed but looks something like this-\n\n1\\. Day 1\\- Sat\\.
  August 8 – Vancouver\nStay overnight\n2\\. Day 2 – Sun\\. August 9 
 – 9am departure \\- Day trip to Squamish to hike Squamish Valley\n3\\. D
 ay 3 – Mon\\. August 10 – Garibaldi National Park\\. Leave at 7am to c
 atch the Horsehoe Bay Ferry Terminal to Nanaimo\nHike Neck Point Lake in t
 he afternoon/ stay at painted Turtle Guesthouse if available\n4\\. Day 4 
 – Tues\\. August 11 – head to tofino\\-along the way we stop at the ol
 d forest and falls at Cathedral Grove\\. We might check out Mount Benson g
 iven time constraints\\.\nStay at hi hostel tofino\n5\\. Day 5 \\-Wed\\. A
 ugust 12 – 9am departure – Hike Wild Pacific Trail and swim at Florenc
 ia Bay\n6\\. Day 6 – Thurs\\. August 13 – 10am departure \\- Pacific R
 im to Tofino – Rain forest trail\\\, Long Beach and explore the town –
  optional tour if interested\n7\\. Day 7 – Fri\\. August 14 – 7 am dep
 arture – Catch the water taxi – 30\\.return plus 10\\. Park fee\\. Hik
 e Lone Cone Trail then head back to Vancouver\n8\\. Day 8 – Sat\\. Aug 1
 5 – Head back to Vancouver\n9\\. Day 9 \\- Sun\\. Aug 16 – Return to T
 oronto
